+ * @param locale
+ *     The current locale.  See @ref compose-locale.
+ *     \n
+ *     The value is copied, so it is safe to pass the result of `getenv(3)`
+ *     (or similar) without fear of it being invalidated by a subsequent
+ *     `setenv(3)` (or similar).
